## 1. 范围 / Scope

本许可自引入本文件的提交起，适用于权利人有权按本许可提供的本项目原创代码、程序、固件、文档、图片、机械设计、模型及其导出文件（“作品”）。第三方内容、历史授权和单独书面授权依第 6 条处理。公开可见不表示公有领域或标准开源授权。

From the commit introducing this file, this license covers original project code, software, firmware, documentation, images, mechanical designs, models and exports (the “Work”) that the respective rightsholders are entitled to license on these terms. Third-party material, earlier grants and separate written permissions are governed by section 6. Public availability does not mean public domain or an open-source license.

## 2. 允许的个人用途 / Permitted personal use

自然人可为自己的非商业学习、研究、试验、爱好及私人日常使用，免费下载、复制、备份、运行和修改作品，并制作或 3D 打印供本人自用的实体。许可为非独占、不可转授权；不允许代表雇主、客户、公司或其他组织使用，也不自动豁免教育、科研或慈善机构。个人研究不得以预期商业应用为目的。

An individual may download, copy, back up, run and modify the Work free of charge for their own noncommercial learning, research, experiments, hobbies and private everyday use, and make or 3D-print physical items for their own use. This license is nonexclusive and non-sublicensable. It does not permit use on behalf of an employer, customer, company or other organization, and provides no automatic exemption for educational, research or charitable institutions. Personal research must not be directed toward an anticipated commercial application.

## 3. 未授予的用途 / Uses not granted

未经相应权利人另行书面授权，不得：
- 将作品或修改版用于商业项目、企业内部业务、客户交付、商业研发，或集成进商业产品、固件、硬件、服务或 SaaS；是否直接收费不改变此限制。
- 销售、出租、转授权作品或其修改版，提供收费托管、部署、安装、刷写、制造或打印服务，或出售基于本项目设计制作的外壳、套件或其他实体。
- 为广告、赞助、引流、捆绑销售或其他商业利益使用作品。
- 向第三方分发、镜像或提供作品、修改版、二进制包或基于设计制作的实体，无论有偿或无偿，但第 4 条的有限协作例外除外。

Without separate written permission from the relevant rightsholders, you may not:
- Use the Work or modifications in commercial projects, internal business operations, customer deliverables or commercial research, or integrate them into commercial products, firmware, hardware, services or SaaS, whether or not a direct fee is charged.
- Sell, rent or sublicense the Work or modifications; offer paid hosting, deployment, installation, firmware flashing, manufacturing or printing services; or sell enclosures, kits or other physical items made from project designs.
- Use the Work for advertising, sponsorship, lead generation, bundled sales or other commercial benefit.
- Distribute, mirror or provide the Work, modifications, binaries or physical items made from the designs to third parties, for payment or free of charge, except for the limited collaboration exception in section 4.

## 4. 有限协作与声明保留 / Limited collaboration and notices

允许通过官方仓库及其托管平台的正常 fork / Pull Request / Issue 流程，为向官方提交非商业修复或改进而复制、修改和展示必要内容。该例外不允许经营独立分发渠道、发布 fork 安装包或商业使用。可分享官方页面链接。保留著作权、许可及第三方声明，明确标识修改；不得暗示官方认可。贡献者仅可提交有权提供的内容，贡献按本许可提供，不转让著作权，也不授予维护者额外商业转授权权利。

You may copy, modify and display necessary material through the official repository and its hosting platform's normal fork, Pull Request and Issue workflows solely to contribute noncommercial fixes or improvements upstream. This exception does not permit independent distribution channels, fork binary releases or commercial use. Sharing links to official pages is permitted. Preserve copyright, license and third-party notices, identify modifications, and do not imply official endorsement. Contributors must have the right to submit their contributions, which are offered under this license without assigning copyright or granting maintainers additional commercial sublicensing rights.

