未明确授予的权利均保留；不授予商标权或未明确授予的专利权。违反本许可即终止本许可项下授权；停止未经授权的使用及分发，删除仅依赖本许可持有的副本；恢复授权需相关权利人书面同意。法律规定不可排除的权利不受影响。

All rights not expressly granted are reserved. No trademark rights or unexpressed patent rights are granted. Breach terminates permissions under this license; cease unauthorized use and distribution and delete copies held solely under this license. Reinstatement requires written permission from the relevant rightsholders. Non-waivable statutory rights remain unaffected.

