第三方依赖、参考模型、素材及其嵌入内容继续适用各自原许可；本许可不重新授权、不收紧也不扩大其权利。来源或授权不明的内容不因本文件获得使用或分发许可。此前已合法取得的 MIT、PolyForm 或其他授权不被追溯撤销；历史提交、标签及发行附件仍按当时随附条款处理。相应权利人可对自己拥有的权利另行书面授权；本许可不限制权利人使用自己的作品。普通用户数据和不含作品受保护内容的独立输出不会仅因使用工具而适用本许可；基于受许可设计制作的实体仍受第 2、3 条约束。

Third-party dependencies, reference models, assets and embedded material retain their own licenses; this license neither relicenses them nor expands or restricts their rights. Material with unknown provenance or permission is not licensed for use or distribution by this file. Previously lawfully obtained MIT, PolyForm or other grants are not retroactively revoked; historical commits, tags and release assets retain their accompanying terms. Rightsholders may separately license rights they own in writing; this license does not restrict their use of their own work. Ordinary user data and independent output containing no protected material from the Work do not become subject to this license merely through use of a tool; physical items made from licensed designs remain subject to sections 2 and 3.

